<div class="n12-running" aria-hidden="true"><div><span>Organza Al Ahmar</span><i>✦</i><span>THE COLLECTION · LEBANON</span><i>✦</i><span>Discover · Save · Enquire</span><i>✦</i><span>Made for your own point of view</span><i>✦</i><span>Organza Al Ahmar</span><i>✦</i><span>THE COLLECTION · LEBANON</span><i>✦</i><span>Discover · Save · Enquire</span><i>✦</i><span>Made for your own point of view</span><i>✦</i><span>Organza Al Ahmar</span><i>✦</i><span>THE COLLECTION · LEBANON</span><i>✦</i><span>Discover · Save · Enquire</span><i>✦</i><span>Made for your own point of view</span><i>✦</i><span>Organza Al Ahmar</span><i>✦</i><span>THE COLLECTION · LEBANON</span><i>✦</i><span>Discover · Save · Enquire</span><i>✦</i><span>Made for your own point of view</span><i>✦</i></div></div>
<section class="section first-edit" data-reveal><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">FIND YOUR NEXT FAVOURITE</span><h2>Good looks.<br/><em>Your own way.</em></h2></div><div><p>A selection from the collection.<br/>Keep the looks you love close.</p><a href="/shop" class="text-link">Discover the whole edit </a></div></div><div class="product-grid">@foreach(var p in Shop.Products.Take(4)){<partial name="_Card" model="p"/>}</div></section>
<section class="fashion-story" data-reveal><div class="fashion-story-photo"><img src="@Shop.Settings.Story" alt="A closer look at Organza Al Ahmar" width="900" height="1200" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="fashion-story-copy"><span class="eyebrow">THE WORLD OF ORGANZA AL AHMAR</span><h2>The collection.<br/><em>The personal connection.</em></h2><p>Organza Al Ahmar presents wedding and evening dresses through its official profile. Explore bridal and occasionwear inspiration, save the references you like and contact the team to discuss an appointment and the exact options available.</p><a href="/our-world" class="button outline">Discover our world <span></span></a></div></section>
<section class="section category-edit" data-reveal><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE DIRECTION</span><h2>What are you<br/><em>in the mood for?</em></h2></div><a href="/style-guide" class="text-link">Help me choose </a></div><div class="category-grid">@foreach(var (category,i) in Shop.Products.Select(p=>p.Collection).Distinct().Take(3).Select((x,i)=>(x,i))){var p=Shop.Products.First(p=>p.Collection==category);<a href="/shop?collection=@Uri.EscapeDataString(category)"><div><img src="@p.Images[0]" alt="@category from Organza Al Ahmar" width="700" height="930" loading="lazy"/></div><span>@category <b></b></span></a>}</div></section>
<section class="section diary-feature" data-reveal><div><span class="eyebrow">THE VISUAL DIARY</span><h2>A detail.<br/>A different angle.<br/><em>A new favourite.</em></h2><p>Explore the collection in photographs. Follow a colour, discover a silhouette and gather your inspiration.</p><a href="/lookbook" class="button">Open the photo diary <span></span></a></div><div class="diary-pair"><img src="@Shop.Products.Last().Images[0]" alt="Collection inspiration from Organza Al Ahmar" width="720" height="960" loading="lazy"/><img src="@Shop.Products.Skip(1).First().Images.Last()" alt="More collection details from Organza Al Ahmar" width="520" height="690" loading="lazy"/></div></section>
<section class="section shopping-steps" data-reveal><div><span class="eyebrow">MAKE IT PERSONAL</span><h2>From inspiration<br/><em>to a conversation.</em></h2></div><ol><li><h3>Find your favourites</h3><p>Browse the collection, explore the photographs and save the looks that speak to you.</p></li><li><h3>Build your selection</h3><p>Add your pieces to a bag and share your size, colour and delivery questions.</p></li><li><h3>Talk to the team</h3><p>Review your enquiry before sending. The boutique confirms options, availability and the final price.</p></li></ol></section>
